#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.transform_chunk.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.transform\\_chunk"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform_chunk.transform_chunk:1 of
msgid "Apply func per execution block (chunk). Output must have same row count."
msgstr "按执行块（块）应用函数。输出必须具有相同的行数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform_chunk.transform_chunk:3 of
msgid ""
"Unlike ``apply_chunk``, the output row count must match the input "
"(transform semantics).  The function receives a DataFrame chunk and must "
"return a DataFrame with the same number of rows."
msgstr ""
"与 ``apply_chunk`` 不同，输出行数必须与输入匹配（转换语义）。函数接收一个"
" DataFrame 块并必须返回具有相同行数的 DataFrame。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform_chunk.transform_chunk of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform_chunk.transform_chunk:7 of
msgid ""
"Function taking a DataFrame chunk and returning a DataFrame with the same"
" number of rows.  If ``func`` is a class, it is instantiated once per "
"chunk and ``close()`` (if defined) is always called at the end of the "
"chunk."
msgstr ""
"接收一个 DataFrame 块并返回具有相同行数的 DataFrame 的函数。如果 ``func``"
" 是一个类，则每个块实例化一次，并且始终在块结束时调用 ``close()``（如果已"
"定义）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform_chunk.transform_chunk:14 of
msgid "Frame type passed to ``func``."
msgstr "传递给 ``func`` 的框架类型。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform_chunk.transform_chunk:16 of
msgid "Expected output dtypes."
msgstr "期望的输出数据类型。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform_chunk.transform_chunk:18 of
msgid "If True, skip dtype inference."
msgstr "如果为 True，则跳过数据类型推断。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform_chunk.transform_chunk:20 of
msgid "Extra positional arguments forwarded to ``func``."
msgstr "转发给 ``func`` 的额外位置参数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform_chunk.transform_chunk:22 of
msgid "Extra keyword arguments forwarded to ``func``."
msgstr "转发给 ``func`` 的额外关键字参数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform_chunk.transform_chunk of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform_chunk.transform_chunk:24 of
msgid ""
"Lazy LiteFrame with the same row count as the input, where each value is "
"the per-chunk transform result.  Call ``.execute()`` to materialize."
msgstr ""
"具有与输入相同行数的惰性 LiteFrame，其中每个值是每块转换结果。调用 ``."
"execute()`` 来实例化。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform_chunk.transform_chunk of
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform_chunk.transform_chunk:31 of
msgid ":py:obj:`transform`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform_chunk.transform_chunk:32 of
msgid "Transform per column or per row."
msgstr "按列或按行转换。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform_chunk.transform_chunk:34 of
msgid ":py:obj:`apply_chunk`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform_chunk.transform_chunk:35 of
msgid "Apply a function per execution chunk."
msgstr "按执行块应用函数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform_chunk.transform_chunk:38 of
msgid "示例"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform_chunk.transform_chunk:42 of
msgid "Scale every column within each chunk by a constant (row count preserved):"
msgstr "通过常数缩放每个块中的每一列（保持行数）："

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform_chunk.transform_chunk:52 of
msgid "Replace columns with a derived schema (still same row count):"
msgstr "用派生模式替换列（仍保持相同行数）："


